      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Goal:\r\nBe the first to reach 5 points by correctly guessing coin flips.\r\n\r\nHow
    to Play:\r\n    \r\nAt the start of each round, choose \u201CHeads\u201D or \u201CTails\u201D.\r\nPress
    the End Turn button to flip the coin.\r\nThe coin spins several times and lands
    on Heads or Tails.\r\nIf your guess matches the result:\r\n\u2022    You get
    1 point.\r\nIf your guess is wrong:\r\n\u2022 The AI / opponent gets 1 point.\r\nThe
    scoreboard updates after each flip.\r\nThe first player to reach 5 points wins
    the minigame and it closes / returns you to the overworld."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67667796e1ee0704185fa792acf0bb64, type: 2}
